# PART 1: PROJECT INTRODUCTION

## 1.1 Project Overview

Develop a complete, professional, advanced-level, enterprise-grade Pharmaceutical Distribution Management ERP System named:

**PharmaDist Pro – Pharmaceutical Distribution Management System**

The software will be specifically designed for pharmaceutical distribution businesses operating in Pakistan.

The system must manage the complete operations of pharmaceutical distributors who distribute products from multiple pharmaceutical manufacturers and companies simultaneously.

Examples of pharmaceutical companies include:

- Getz Pharma
- Sami Pharmaceuticals
- CCL Pharmaceuticals
- Indus Pharma
- Hilton Pharma
- Highnoon Laboratories
- Martin Dow
- AGP Limited
- The Searle Company
- Abbott Laboratories
- GSK Pakistan
- Ferozsons Laboratories
- Barrett Hodgson
- Bosch Pharmaceuticals
- Other local and multinational pharmaceutical companies.

A single distributor may handle products from 5, 10, 20, or more pharmaceutical companies.

The software must provide separate company-wise records and accounts while maintaining consolidated business management through one centralized platform.

The application must be suitable for:

- Pharmaceutical distribution owners.
- Distribution managers.
- General managers.
- Accountants.
- Sales managers.
- Sales representatives.
- Recovery officers.
- Warehouse managers.
- Storekeepers.
