## 11.2 Expiry Return Workflow

1. Identify near-expiry or expired products.
2. Generate expiry report.
3. Select eligible batches.
4. Create expiry return request.
5. Verify quantities.
6. Generate return challan.
7. Submit claim to company.
8. Track approval.
9. Record company credit note.
10. Adjust company ledger.
11. Record claim settlement.

## 11.3 Other Claims

